            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can lie about having taken an action so convincingly that you acquire all the tangible benefits of having successfully completed it.</p>\n<p>You can roll Deception in place of a different skill when attempting to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Earn Income], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Make an Impression], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Request], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Subsist].</p>\n<p>You can use Fabricated Connections to [[/act make-an-impression skill=deception]] or [[/act request skill=deception]] once per day, and you can also use it once per week to Earn Income or [[/act subsist skill=deception]]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 7
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Dandy Dedication"
              },
              {
                "value": "master in Deception"
              }
            ]
          },
